            "target_entity_type": "Metric",
            "paragraph": "Comparison with the CTL simulation (Fig. 1c) shows that the model successfully reproduces the MJ climatological large-scale precipitation and circulation patterns, including the Meiyu rainband, the tropical monsoon trough rainband, and the Pacific subtropical high. The spatial pattern correlation coefficients between CTL and OBS are 0.97 for y850 and 0.70 for precipitation, both statistically significant at the 90% confidence level according to Student's t-test, demonstrating the model's strong ability to reproduce the MJ climatological patterns.",
